# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# The working copies on Windows use CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), but the repo
# stores LF. Without this file a text file that gets rewritten locally shows up
# as a whole-file change (every line modified), which makes real diffs
# impossible to review. Declaring the rules here keeps the stored form stable
# and lets Git handle the CRLF translation on checkout/commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never translate.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.db binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
